        "created_at": "2014-04-24T02:46:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm aware of the Variants forum; the question is more in regards to the specific legal nature of the Villain Contest entries, as <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/rules-forum-please-read\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">they're owned by GTG.</a>&nbsp;That does seem like it would create a different set of issues than simply creating a villain and posting it there.</p>",
