      {
        "id": 100155,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-24T23:16:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>HikariStarshine is&nbsp;not talking about \"made\" as in submitting-an-entry-to-the-contest but \"made\" as in taking-an-idea-from-the-contest-and-releasing-it-as-a-fan-expansion; with the standard boilerplate legal text that went along with submitting an entry to the contest HS is asking if it would be legally allowed or if &gt;G would be all over them like cheese on Tachyon's pizza.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The answer is most probably, let's see what Paul and the others make of this request and see if they respond.</p>",
