        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>HikariStarshine is&nbsp;not talking about &quot;made&quot; as in submitting-an-entry-to-the-contest but &quot;made&quot; as in taking-an-idea-from-the-contest-and-releasing-it-as-a-fan-expansion; with the standard boilerplate legal text that went along with submitting an entry to the contest HS is asking if it would be legally allowed or if &gt;G would be all over them like cheese on Tachyon&#39;s pizza.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The answer is most probably, let&#39;s see what Paul and the others make of this request and see if they respond.</p>",
